      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dependencies point inwards. The Domain knows nothing outside itself. The Application defines the ports it needs, and Infrastructure implements them. Architecture tests enforce this.",
